// P3G.2 (external-references.md ER4.1–ER4.8; lesson-update-all-references.png): Update all
// references through a chain A → B → C. A "Block source" (Block, V1); B "Block sub", whose
// assembly Sub holds A@V1 (version V1); C "Block consumer", whose Assembly 1 holds Sub@V1
// (`linked-block chain`).
// 01 C's Assembly 1: "Sub <1>" with the plain version icon; its tooltip names Block sub › Sub
//    (V1).
// 02 (ER4.1, ER4.2) A edited (depth 40) and V2 made: B has no newer version, but the block inside
//    it has, so C's row shows the transitive icon (a blue ring with an arrow) and the tab its
//    badge; the tooltip "A reference inside it has a newer version".
// 03 (ER4.3) the toolbar's Update all references button.
// 04 (ER4.4, ER4.8) the Reference manager: "Newer versions available for 1 document", "Block
//    sub" "V1 ⇒ new version", and the warning that a new version of Block sub will be made and
//    that undo doesn't remove versions.
// 05 (ER4.5) Update all: B's workspace updated to A@V2 and its auto version V2 made; C points at
//    B@V2: the block is 40 high; the toast "Updated 1 reference", show more details.
// 06 (ER4.6) the details: "Created V2 of Block sub (auto version)", "Block sub: V1 ⇒ new version".
// 07 mass properties of the whole assembly: 50 · 30 · 40 = 60 000 mm³.
// 08 (ER4.8) Ctrl+Z: C back at B@V1 (25 high, the transitive icon again).
// 09 (ER4.7, ER4.8) Insert → Other documents → Block sub → Version graph: V2 is still there, an
//    auto version (open square, "Auto version" in the legend and its subtitle).
// 10 (ER4.7) Block sub opened (`linked-block open-sub`), its History panel: V2 with the auto
//    version marker.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("linked-block"),
        Custom("linked-block chain"),
        Key("F"),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("01-chain-plain-icon"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Custom("linked-block edit"),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("02-transitive-indicator"),
        Hover(ui("update-all-references")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-update-all-button"),
        Click(ui("update-all-references")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-reference-manager-new-version"),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-updated-through-the-chain"),
        Click(ui("refman-details")),
        WaitFor("update-details"),
        Screenshot("06-details-auto-version"),
        Click(ui("update-details-close")),
        Click(ui("instance-root")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-mass-60000"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-undo-keeps-the-version"),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Click(ui("insert-source-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-mine"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-loc-mine")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-doc-block-sub"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-doc-block-sub")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-header"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-graph")),
        WaitFor("insert-graph"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-auto-version-in-graph"),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-cancel")),
        Custom("linked-block open-sub"),
        Click(ui("rail-history")),
        WaitFor("history-panel"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-history-auto-version"),
    ],
)
